1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,600
Milo!

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,750
Look at Mommy!

3
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:05,490
Four hundred photos of the back of his head.

4
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,150
Mine!

5
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:08,230
So we gave him his own camera.

6
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:11,000
Both cameras at once: what he sees, and his face.

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,450
My watch is the remote. One tap,

8
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:14,930
he looks. Snap.

9
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,160
He can tap all he likes. It only makes bubbles.

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,120
No account, no ads. It all stays on the phone.

11
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,870
Mommy!

12
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:26,620
Quack.

13
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:30,400
ToddlerCam. A camera for little hands, and a remote on yours.
